# Real app cadence, no capture. Exactly twenty live human NPCs walk supported
# stock market lanes via their own AI queues. appcadence.csv.json measures FPS.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
off: npccharacter off
on: npccharacter on
npccharacter market
view full
overlay off
wait 1500
cam hold
cadence normal
wait 34
off: npccharacter measure off
on: npccharacter measure on
cadence wait
npccharacter report
